Codeblock Customizer language definitions and SVG icons
======================================================

Source: https://github.com/mugiwara85/CodeblockCustomizer
Source revision: 7e92adb12fccd7bc66ab0984e9503d50e8f1feee
Source file: src/Const.ts (Languages, manualLang, and Icons)
Copyright (c) 2023 mugiwara85
License for the source definitions: LICENSES/CodeblockCustomizer-MIT.txt

The language tables were regrouped into canonical IDs, labels, and aliases.
The Languages table takes precedence over manualLang, matching CC's lookup.
SVG entries were extracted into separate files in src/icons. SVG fragments
were wrapped in a 32x32 SVG root. Complete SVG roots were nested with their
viewBox retained and their fixed width/height removed, matching CC's framing.
No artwork was intentionally redrawn or recolored.

